WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.967
Create a reusable test suite.

2
00:00:04.967 --> 00:00:11.067
Name the suite for its purpose.

3
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:15.633
Choose which checks belong in the suite.

4
00:00:15.633 --> 00:00:22.250
Use the smoke tag to select the release checks.

5
00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:27.400
Review the matching cases before saving.

6
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:33.267
Save the suite for future runs.

7
00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:41.450
Open the saved suite and start a run.

8
00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:51.117
Name this execution of the smoke suite.

9
00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:58.133
Create a fresh run with its own results.

10
00:00:58.133 --> 00:01:02.350
Start working through the selected cases.
